5,1,1,talk,Mio,,I’m worried about the hiring bottleneck. Who else feels we’re spending too much time just finding people?,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,George,,I’ve seen that pattern before. We often underestimate the operational weight of staffing. Let’s look at the delivery records to see where time actually goes.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,"I’m all for checking the delivery records, George. But honestly, I’m more worried about our cash flow. Who else is tracking where our money is actually going?","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to check the independent checks on holdings' reported figures! I need to know if we can actually verify the numbers before we add more.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I’m concerned about external delays. I’ll check the delivery records of two holdings to see what actually stalls progress.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@George, I’m also picking delivery records! I want to see if staffing delays are the real culprit behind those missed timelines.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,George,,I’ll look into the profile of the exits and the write-off. I need to see which business models actually held up.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,I’m picking reserve accounts and follow-on calls. I need to know exactly what our future obligations look like before we commit more cash.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,I’m also picking the appraisal needs at the last audit! I need to know how much extra work a new holding adds to our quarter-end.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,I’ll also check the security review time before first deployment. I need to know if compliance is the hidden bottleneck slowing us down.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,"@May, I’m picking retained recruiters’ placement times. I need to know if we can actually find the people we need right now.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,George,,I’ll examine the terms of last winter’s credit line. I need to understand our borrowing capacity before we commit further capital.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,I’m also picking the terms of last winter’s credit line. I need to know exactly what we can borrow against when the follow-on calls hit.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,I’m picking the adviser bench and partner board seats! I want to see who actually has time to help us close the books.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"I’ll check account retention through price rises. I need to see if customers stay when costs go up, or if we’re just signing up for churn.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mio,,I’m done picking! I’ve got my two: delivery records and recruiter times. Let’s hear what everyone else found out next round!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,George,,I’ll review the exit profile and the credit line terms. Experience suggests we must understand our borrowing capacity before committing further capital.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,May,,I’m locking in reserve accounts and credit line terms. I need to know exactly what we can borrow against when the follow-on calls hit.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Rin,,I’m locking in appraisal needs and adviser bench! I need to know if we can actually close the books without extra fees or missing help.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,I’m locking in security review times and account retention. I need to know if compliance or churn is the real obstacle we’re signing up for.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
