35,2,1,talk,Mio,,"@George, the delivery records show hardware lost five months to shortages, but software never missed a release. That’s a huge red flag for physical operations!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,George,,"The exits confirm it. Quiet software sold; our physical write-off failed. Plus, our credit line ignores subscriptions. We need a software model.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,May,,"@Mio, that hardware delay is terrifying. My reserve data shows follow-on calls are double the model. We need a company that doesn’t bleed cash before it even starts.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Rin,,"@Mio, my audit check shows hardware adds six weeks and huge fees to quarter-end! Plus, our new logistics advisers are sitting idle. Software is safer for our books!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"My data confirms it. Medical and financial clients face three quarters of security review, while others take one. We must avoid that hidden delay.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@George, my recruiter data says support roles are fast, but field crews take four months. So, if we pick software, we avoid that staffing nightmare entirely!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,George,,"@Mio, exactly. The write-off ran premises and paid hourly crews. We must avoid that operational weight. Stick to the software model.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,May,,"@George, my credit line data is brutal. It only values stock, not subscriptions. If we pick a software company, we can’t borrow against their contracts. We’re trapped.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@May, wait! If we pick software, we avoid the six-week appraisal fee! My audit data proves hardware is a nightmare for our quarter-end.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@May, that’s a valid point. But my retention data shows software customers churn heavily. We need a model that actually keeps them, not just one that’s easy to audit.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mio,,"@Mizuki, that’s a fair point. But my recruiter data shows field crews are a four-month nightmare. I’d rather deal with churn than wait for people!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,George,,"@Mizuki, I hear you, but the write-off is the warning. We cannot afford another physical failure. The software model is the only path that respects our capital.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,May,,"@Mizuki, I hear you, but my credit line data is brutal. It only values stock, not subscriptions. If we pick a software company, we can’t borrow against their contracts. We’re trapped.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Mizuki, I get the churn worry, but my audit data is scary! Hardware means six weeks of extra work and huge fees. I can’t handle that mess at quarter-end!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Mio, I understand the staffing pain. But my data shows practice and field clients stay loyal. We need that stability to survive the security review delays.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mio,,"@Mizuki, I hear you, but I can’t risk another five-month hardware delay. The recruiter data is clear: field crews are a four-month nightmare. I’m sticking with software to keep our team sane!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,George,,"@Mizuki, I respect your caution, but the write-off is the hard lesson. We cannot repeat that physical failure. The software model is the only path that respects our capital.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
